cff-version: 1.2.0
title: >-
  Validator-first factor research agent: statistical gates inside the
  discovery loop
message: If you use this software, please cite it as below.
type: software
version: 0.1.0
authors:
  - alias: Ye-Yuan-95
repository-code: "https://github.com/Ye-Yuan-95/factor-agent"
abstract: >-
  Research software for factor candidate generation, statistical validation,
  portfolio evaluation and synthetic experiments. Includes source-bound process
  certificates, a one-shot test lockbox and empirical FDP, false-positive-rate
  and power reporting under explicit truth definitions and sample limits.
  The real-data adapter is A-share specific.
keywords:
  - factor investing
  - false discovery rate
  - deflated sharpe ratio
  - research agent
  - point-in-time data
license: Apache-2.0
